OL,3,GNEWSAProtest delays red route
OL,4,Aintroduction, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA protest against plans to prevent
OL,7,Fdrivers from stopping in an East Sussex
OL,8,Fstreet has delayed its introduction, a
OL,9,Fcouncil has said.
OL,11,FDozens of people took to Western Road
OL,12,Fin Hove on Thursday night to object to
OL,13,Fa red route being introduced along
OL,14,Fparts of the busy shopping street.
OL,16,FBusiness owners and residents have
OL,17,Fcampaigned against the scheme, which
OL,18,Fwas due to begin this weekend and is
OL,19,Fnow delayed, along with the reopening
OL,20,Fof the road, until Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
