OL,3,GNEWSAProtest delays red route
OL,4,Aintroduction, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council statement said: "Our
OL,7,Fcontractors and council staff have
OL,8,Fworked tirelessly to ensure remaining
OL,9,Fwork will take place as soon as
OL,10,Fpossible and that staff undertaking the
OL,11,Fwork are safe."
